{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the apprentice of a fungal priest, sent to trace a distress signal pulsing through the mycelial network. The mysterious city of Upper Morkezela awaits your arrival. Within its collapsing scrapers and humming markets, machines still pray, dead gods dream, waiting to rise again, and somewhere in the rot, there is something hidden in the Egg Cathedral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with citizens and symbionts who no longer remember where their bodies end. Trade memories for relics, your own spores for drugs, rewrite your own anatomy by embracing symbionts and align yourself with factions that feed or resist the city\u2019s slow decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat. Only language, spores, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Upper Morkezela grows or decays with every word you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong> \u2013 A 2D adventure focused on dialogue, atmosphere, and discovery rather than puzzles or combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth/Decay world state</strong> \u2013 Every decision alters ecosystems, NPC behavior, and story tone. City locations may change depending on your choices, based on unique <strong>Growth/Decay </strong>system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbiont companions</strong> \u2013 Merge with sentient symbiont creaturs that grant new abilities.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118600?t=1761589823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118600?t=1761589823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118600/b2d72f41ab52810b2b79b4847b86336665bf9fe5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761589823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118600/b2d72f41ab52810b2b79b4847b86336665bf9fe5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761589823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild references to fictional drugs and altered mental states depicted in a surreal, dreamlike context."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the apprentice of a fungal priest, sent to trace a distress signal pulsing through the mycelial network. The mysterious city of Upper Morkezela awaits your arrival. Within its collapsing scrapers and humming markets, machines still pray, dead gods dream, waiting to rise again, and somewhere in the rot, there is something hidden in the Egg Cathedral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with citizens and symbionts who no longer remember where their bodies end. Trade memories for relics, your own spores for drugs, rewrite your own anatomy by embracing symbionts and align yourself with factions that feed or resist the city\u2019s slow decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat. Only language, spores, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Upper Morkezela grows or decays with every word you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong> \u2013 A 2D adventure focused on dialogue, atmosphere, and discovery rather than puzzles or combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth/Decay world state</strong> \u2013 Every decision alters ecosystems, NPC behavior, and story tone. City locations may change depending on your choices, based on unique <strong>Growth/Decay </strong>system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbiont companions</strong> \u2013 Merge with sentient symbiont creaturs that grant new abilities.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tempurra Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118600/a182254a54a9633ad7ea62a784de863e47d1c2f6/header.jpg?t=1761589823","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118600/1094707754/e926bfcdb4461a81be75fdac151109ea0a116d6c/1760694884/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761589821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118600/1094707754/e926bfcdb4461a81be75fdac151109ea0a116d6c/1760694884/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761589821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118600/1094707754/e926bfcdb4461a81be75fdac151109ea0a116d6c/1760694884/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761589821","id":257219181,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219181/movie480.mp4?t=1761589821","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219181/movie_max.mp4?t=1761589821"},"name":"Infinite Fold","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219181/a5702c34f2f79c4865c5d7f963ac81247a996c27/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761589821","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219181/movie480.webm?t=1761589821","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219181/movie_max.webm?t=1761589821"}}],"name":"Upper Morkezela: A Weird Game","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with 1 GB VRAM